Current list of drivers to be implemented and the status of re-implementation
=====================================================

bus
 * drvEISABus - crashing; reconstructed against the reference binary, fixes applied, not yet retested
 * drvPCIBus - reconstructed against the reference binary; the kernel DriverKit pass found its testIDs:dev:fun:bus: prototype diverges from Apple's, not yet reconciled
 * drvPCMCIABus - compiles; reconstructed against the reference binary, fixes applied, not yet tested; protocol records, every class instance size and ivar layout are byte-identical to the reference; two heap overflows from undeclared ivars fixed
 * Intel824X0PCI - reconstructed against the reference binary, fixes applied, not yet compiled or tested
 * Intel82365PCMCIA - compiles; reconstructed against the reference binary, all fixes applied; its five ObjC protocol records and four adoptions are byte-identical to the reference, not yet tested

ide
 * drvEIDE - complete
 * drvPCFloppy - reconstructed against Apple's Floppy_reloc; not yet tested on hardware

input
 * drvBusMouse - compiles; reconstructed against the reference binary, fixes applied, not yet tested
 * drvISASerialPort - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvPCParallel - compiles; reconstructed against the reference binary, fixes applied, not yet tested
 * drvPS2Keyboard - compiles; reconstructed against the reference binary, fixes applied, not yet tested
 * drvPS2Mouse - compiles; reconstructed against the reference binary, fixes applied, not yet tested
 * drvSerialPointingDevice - compiles; reconstructed against the reference binary, fixes applied, not yet tested

network
 * drvAMDPCNet32II - complete
 * drvDEC21X4X - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvDEC21142 - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvDECchip21040 - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvDECchip21140 - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvEtherExpress16 - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvEtherLink3 - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvEtherLinkXL - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvIntel82556 - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvIntel82557 - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvIntel82595 - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvIntel82596
 * drvNE2k - complete
 * drvSMC16 - complete
 * drvSMCUltra - complete
 * drvVMwareVMXNet - complete

scsi
 (see docs/drivers/scsi-reconstruction.md - four of these are stubs on the
  wrong hardware model, not partial reconstructions)
 * drvAdaptec6X60 - stub on the wrong architecture; reconstruction in progress
 * drvAdaptec1542B - reconstructed against the reference binary, no divergences; not yet compiled
 * drvAdaptec2940 - stub, 10/170 reference functions; missing the whole SCSIBus class
 * drvAMDPCSCSIDriver - complete
 * drvBusLogic - reconstructed against the reference binary, fixes applied; not yet compiled
 * drvBusLogicFP - stub, 7/123 reference functions
 * drvDPT2000 - stub, 10/55 reference functions; missing the whole EATASCSIBus class
 * drvSym53C8xx - stub, 12/158 reference functions; reference is a 136-function CAM/SIM

sound
 * drvBeepSound - compiles; reconstructed against the reference binary, fixes applied, not yet tested
 * drvES1x88Sound - compiles; reconstructed against the reference binary, fixes applied, not yet tested
 * drvIntelAC97Sound - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvSB8Sound - compiles; reconstructed against the reference binary, fixes applied, not yet tested
 * drvSB16Sound - compiles; reconstructed against the reference binary, fixes applied, not yet tested
 * drvSB128Sound - complete

video
 * drv3DfxVoodooVSA - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvATIMach64
 * drvATIRage
 * drvCirrusLogicGD5434
 * drvIBMThinkPad760EDDisplay
 * drvMatroxMGA - complete
 * drvNVidiaRiva - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvS3Generic - complete
 * drvQVision - complete
 * drvVBoxVideo - complete
 * drvVMWareVideo - complete
 * drvVGA - reconstruction in progress

other (these live at src/drvBPF and src/drvPortServer, not under drivers-i386)
 * drvBPF - reconstructed against the reference binary, fixes applied, not yet compiled or tested
 * drvPortServer - reconstructed against the reference binary, five pre-existing compile blockers repaired, fixes applied, not yet compiled or tested
